tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-wyRzBMqq' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-10-17 18:21:06.639 xcodebuild[6646:70601690]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-10-17 18:21:07.089 xcodebuild[6646:70601689] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\ncommit 150cb3debc5fb9c4794ef2c477be07915c5b707c\nAuthor:     Sonny To <son.c.to@gmail.com>\nAuthorDate: Sat Oct 17 18:19:46 2026 +0700\nCommit:     Sonny To <son.c.to@gmail.com>\nCommitDate: Sat Oct 17 18:19:46 2026 +0700\n\n    fix(yin.repl): join the poller indefinitely on shutdown; comprehension prompt regression test\n    \n    Stdin EOF queues (quit) but -main joined the poller for only\n    stop-join-millis (~5s), discarding queued slow work - piping a script\n    into the REPL lost everything past the first lines. The poller ends\n    itself after the shutdown drain (stop-ticks bounded); the headless path\n    already waited this way.\n    \n    The appended regression test spawns the JVM REPL, selects\n    :yang.python/antlr, submits the owner's filtered comprehension and\n    print(len(...)), closes stdin, and asserts the process exits within 90s\n    with the outputs flushed. The prompt regex is escaped properly and the\n    reader thread is joined before the output snapshot (gate P2).\n\n src/cljc/yin/repl/main.cljc        |  6 ++++-\n test/yin/repl/dht_process_test.clj | 52 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 2 files changed, 57 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
